BAR_ROOT monkeypatch in that test, so repo_root resolves to the real worktree). Pre-existing on main (reproduced at f9fe49b06 with a clean tree); masked everywhere the symlink already exists. Expected: rendering --help must not write to the repo root; the test should also isolate REBAR_ROOT. Acceptance criteria: (1) running the help test in a fresh worktree with no .tickets-tracker passes with no leak-check error and creates no symlink; (2) identify and pin the code path that bootstraps the tracker symlink on a read-only/help path with a regression test; (3) make lint, make typecheck, and the default suite exit zero.","env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","file_impact":[],"keyring":[],"last_status_env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","managed_refs":[],"parent_id":null,"parent_status_uuid":"5a894a1a-36c8-4ba3-afd6-fcd0b9dcb03d","plan_review_phase":"execution","preconditions_summary":{"status":"pre-manifest"},"priority":2,"reverts":[],"status":"in_progress","tags":[],"ticket_id":"dd62-2791-6413-4ae0","ticket_type":"bug","title":"review-plan --help leaks a .tickets-tracker symlink into a fresh worktree's repo root during tests","verify_commands":[]},"source_event_uuids":["a9e26478-7c4c-4358-ba0a-3c9e2181ef6e","ba398a41-4272-4986-be85-2df3d742004c","5a894a1a-36c8-4ba3-afd6-fcd0b9dcb03d","80e4ce73-4a79-479d-a7a5-cbd2d2ca650c","2539f43e-3374-4ec5-815f-4e56601574cb"]},"env_id":"ade0f2ef-51cc-45a2-bb97-c09846cd3df5","event_type":"SNAPSHOT","timestamp":1784972522106675555,"uuid":"14e38f58-c45d-4594-92ac-75a23aac69de"}